sowing as proof of viability or future food production.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"berry-propagation-trial\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can seeds from a locally harvested berry establish a new shared berry plant on suitable open soil?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Learned propagate-from-seed at tick 40.\\\",\\\"Extracted one seed lot and berry pulp at tick 44; seed viability remains unknown.\\\",\\\"Inspection at 17.5,7.5 at tick 52 reported ordinary soil, moisture 0.65, three berry plants within five metres, and a non-sowable overlapping worksite.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"A suitable unoccupied site, seed viability, emergence and eventual fruit production remain unverified.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Carry out one small planting trial and monitor actual establishment while retaining food reserves.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Learned propagation interface\\\",\\\"Extracted one seed lot\\\",\\\"Inspected an initial site\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"One owned berry seed lot\\\",\\\"Recorded initial site conditions\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Successful sowing and observed establishment.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Attempt sowing at a nearby offset clear of my occupied coordinate, then inspect the result.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"Extraction and inspection supplied direct evidence; no new food production has been observed.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":null,\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

